{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791796740, "covers_from": "2026-10-12T09:19:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-12T09:20:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791796800, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-12T09:19:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 35348, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "人走的時候就是准許只有人走，車子走時只准許車子通行，即使時間會拉長，但每個人至少知道現在此刻是安全的", "display_name": "大同代表 No.35,348", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T09:19:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 47590, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "公車停停走走跟沒辦法靠邊再停車，常是因為停靠區前後紅線違停的車輛，市府應該主動出擊加強執法。", "display_name": "中山代表 No.47,590", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T09:19:30+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 23555, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "很想知道為什麼一直砍樹 看著大樹有一一倒下卻無法做什麼的感覺很難受", "display_name": "文山代表 No.23,555", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-12T09:19:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 19, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 5686, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "對不起我就是在內湖上班住在下新莊的偽台北市民，內湖交通困境就是我造成的，我也想住內湖但太貴真的辦不到", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.5,686", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 47590, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.47,590", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 23555, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 No.23,555", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 5686, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.5,686", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 16686, "sprite_key": "penguin_cu